* ---- v2 LAYOUT EDGE DUMMIES (8 devices) - NOT a schematic change ----
* One tied-off dummy at each end of each of the 4 device rows (rows A, B nfet; PL, PH pfet), same finger W and L as
* the row's outermost device, nf = 1.  Every terminal is on the row supply: nfet D = G = S = B = vss, pfet D = G = S =
* B = vdd (tied by an M1 plate to the bottom vss rail / the internal vdd rail).  They carry no current and do not
* change the circuit; netgen keeps devices with all terminals shorted, so a reference for this layout must list them.
* The released schematic (circuit_files/xschem/strong_arm_comp.sch, 21 devices) is unchanged.
XDA vss vss vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
XDAr vss vss vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
XDB vss vss vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=3u nf=1
XDBr vss vss vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=3u nf=1
XDPL vdd vdd vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
XDPLr vdd vdd vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
XDPH vdd vdd vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
XDPHr vdd vdd vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=4u nf=1
.ends


